  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kalomo DWA Cooking Oil Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (oilseeds), Beneficiaries: 2,160 smallholder farmers, Town/city: Kalomo District, Southern Province, Summary: The project funds will enable the members of Kalomo DWDA to expand their oilseed production and establishing an oil processing facility. Kalomo will establish a seed revolving fund to purchase improved seeds for farmers and a purchase fund to buy oilseeds directly from the farmers. They will also hire a dedicated management team and carry out trainings in sustainable agriculture, oil processing, enterprise development and financial systems. They will procure an oil expeller machine and a metal storage silo. They will gain expertise by carrying out a study tour to a similar enterprise in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
